$\n\nII. $(-3,-9)\\in Y$\n\nIII. $(-9,6)\\in Y$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 true] [17592186287796 1071 "For the sets $Z={-3,6,-9}$ and $Y=Z\\times Z,$ determine which of the following statements are true.\n\n- $(-3,6,-3)\\in Y$\n- $(-3,-9)\\in Y$\n- $(-9,6)\\in Y$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 false] [17592186351180 1071 "What is the cardinality of $H\\times K$ for $H=\\{1,2,3,…,9\\}$ and $K=\\{x,y\\}?$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 true] [17592186351180 1071 "What is the cardinality of $H\\times K$ for $H={1,2,3,…,9}$ and $K={x,y}?$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 false] [17592186389902 1071 "Which of the following is a schematic of the Cartesian product $A\\times B$ for $A=\\{p,q\\}$ and $B=\\{w,z\\}?$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 true] [17592186389902 1071 "Which of the following is a schematic of the Cartesian product $A\\times B$ for $A={p,q}$ and $B={w,z}?$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 false] [17592186420985 1071 "If $A=\\{-2,2\\}$ and $B=\\{c,d\\},$ which of the following elements belong to $(A\\times B)\\times B?$\n\nI. $(-2,d,c)$\n\nII. $(-2,(c,d))$\n\nIII. $((2,d),c)$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 true] [17592186420985 1071 "If $A={-2,2}$ and $B={c,d},$ which of the following elements belong to $(A\\times B)\\times B?$\n\n- $(-2,d,c)$\n- $(-2,(c,d))$\n- $((2,d),c)$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 false] [17592186420986 1071 "For the sets $A=\\{0,1,2\\},$ $B=\\{4,6,8\\},$ and $C=A\\times B,$ determine which of the following statements are true.\n\nI. $(0,2)\\in C$\n\nII. $(1,8)\\in C$\n\nIII. $(0,6)\\in C$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 true] [17592186420986 1071 "For the sets $A={0,1,2},$ $B={4,6,8},$ and $C=A\\times B,$ determine which of the following statements are true.\n\n- $(0,2)\\in C$\n- $(1,8)\\in C$\n- $(0,6)\\in C$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 false] [17592186420987 1071 "What is the cardinality of $Z\\times X$ for $Z=\\{p,q,r\\}$ and $X=\\{-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3\\}?$" 13194139534434 17592186045417 true] [17592186420987 1071 "What is the car